    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patch me if you can is a unique puzzle adventure where you dive into a game world, freely manipulate objects, and embark on an epic quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the Bugs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Glitch Vision to uncover broken objects hidden throughout the world. Click on glowing pink anomalies to open their status window and manipulate them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/7949f96aec0d399659a853d5177d65ea.poster.avif?t=1753946628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/7949f96aec0d399659a853d5177d65ea.webm?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/7949f96aec0d399659a853d5177d65ea.mp4?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fix the World Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip light, rotation, scale, or control blocks in the status window to freely control each object. Shrink boulders, move the sun, or experiment with clever combinations to reshape the world to solve puzzles with your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/9d1140debee6161e91b2039000a10233.poster.avif?t=1753946628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/9d1140debee6161e91b2039000a10233.webm?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/9d1140debee6161e91b2039000a10233.mp4?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue Your Daughter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your beloved daughter is trapped in a bug-riddled game world. As both her father and the creator of this world, you must outwit a cunning Lord and use your creativity to bring her back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/0ff25a3bd3e3e9403513522caa30070c.poster.avif?t=1753946628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/0ff25a3bd3e3e9403513522caa30070c.webm?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/0ff25a3bd3e3e9403513522caa30070c.mp4?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patch me if you can is a unique puzzle adventure where you dive into a game world, freely manipulate objects, and embark on an epic quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the Bugs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Glitch Vision to uncover broken objects hidden throughout the world. Click on glowing pink anomalies to open their status window and manipulate them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/7949f96aec0d399659a853d5177d65ea.poster.avif?t=1753946628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/7949f96aec0d399659a853d5177d65ea.webm?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/7949f96aec0d399659a853d5177d65ea.mp4?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fix the World Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip light, rotation, scale, or control blocks in the status window to freely control each object. Shrink boulders, move the sun, or experiment with clever combinations to reshape the world to solve puzzles with your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/9d1140debee6161e91b2039000a10233.poster.avif?t=1753946628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/9d1140debee6161e91b2039000a10233.webm?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/9d1140debee6161e91b2039000a10233.mp4?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rescue Your Daughter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your beloved daughter is trapped in a bug-riddled game world. As both her father and the creator of this world, you must outwit a cunning Lord and use your creativity to bring her back. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/0ff25a3bd3e3e9403513522caa30070c.poster.avif?t=1753946628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/0ff25a3bd3e3e9403513522caa30070c.webm?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827840/extras/0ff25a3bd3e3e9403513522caa30070c.mp4?t=1753946628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Patch me if you can is a puzzle adventure where you dive into a game world and manipulate objects however you want. Equip blocks to shrink boulders, move the sun, and thwart Lord's conspiracy. This broken world needs your 'patch'!",
